            <title>[IGNITE-845] TcpDiscoveryCloudIpFinderSelfTest.testAmazonWebServices always fails on public TC</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-845</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;AWS didn&apos;t authorize us when the amazon test is run on the public TC from docker containers. Everything is fine on the private TC (configuration is identical on both TCs). Noted that ignite-aws module&apos;s tests are also failing on the public TC. Probably there is some docker + aws related issue. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
